parameters.help_en:
The content of the key policy in JSON format. The maximum length is 32,768 bytes.
For more information about key policies, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html. If you do not specify this parameter, the default key policy is used.

The key policy includes the following fields:

Version: The version of the key policy. Only version 1 is supported.
Statement: The statements of the key policy. Each key policy contains one or more statements.

The key policy uses the following format:

```
{
  "Version": "1",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "Enable RAM User Permissions",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "RAM": ["acs:ram::112890462****:root"]
      },
      "Action": [
        "kms:*"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "condition operator": {
          "condition key": "condition value"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Statement details:
Sid: Optional. The custom statement identifier. It can be up to 128 characters in length and can contain uppercase letters (A-Z), lowercase letters (a-z), digits (0-9), and special characters (_/+=.@-).
Effect: Required. Specifies whether to allow or deny the permissions in the policy statement. Valid values: Allow and Deny.

Principal: Required. The principal to which the policy is attached. You can set this field to the current Alibaba Cloud account (the account to which the key belongs), RAM users or RAM roles under the current Alibaba Cloud account, or RAM users or RAM roles under other Alibaba Cloud accounts.

Action: Required. The API operations to allow or deny. The value must start with "kms:". For the scope of the operation permission list, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html. If you specify operations outside the list, the settings do not take effect.

Resource: Required. The value can only be *, which indicates the current KMS key.

Condition: Optional. The conditions that must be met for the authorization to take effect. You can use conditions to evaluate the context of API requests to determine whether the policy statement applies. The format is `"Condition": {"condition operator": {"condition key": "condition value"}}`. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html.

After you grant permissions to RAM users or RAM roles under other Alibaba Cloud accounts, you must still use the Alibaba Cloud accounts of the RAM users or RAM roles to authorize them to use the key in the RAM console. Only then can the RAM users or RAM roles use the key. For specific operations, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/480682.html, https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/116146.html, and https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/116147.html

parameters.help_zh:
密钥策略的具体内容，JSON格式。最大长度为32768个字节。
关于密钥策略的详细介绍，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html。不输入该参数时，使用默认凭据策略。

密钥策略内容包含：

Version：密钥策略的版本，目前版本仅支持设置为1。
Statement：密钥策略的语句，每个密钥策略包含一个或多个语句。

密钥策略格式为：

```
{
  "Version": "1",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "Enable RAM User Permissions",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "RAM": ["acs:ram::112890462****:root"]
      },
      "Action": [
        "kms:*"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "condition operator": {
          "condition key": "condition value"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Statement详细介绍：
Sid：可选，表示自定义的语句标识符。内容长度小于等于128字符，支持的字符为：大写英文字母（A-Z）、小写英文字母（a-z）、数字（0-9），特殊字符（ _/+=.@-）。
Effect：必选，表示是允许还是拒绝该策略语句中的权限。取值为：Allow或Deny。

Principal：必选，表示权限策略的授权主体，支持设置为当前阿里云账号（即密钥所属的阿里云账号），当前阿里云账号下的RAM用户、RAM角色，其他阿里云账号下的RAM用户、RAM角色。

Action：必选，表示要允许或拒绝的API操作，内容必须以"kms:"开头。操作权限列表的范围，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html。如果您设置了列表外的操作，设置后也不会生效。

Resource：必选，取值只能是*，表示本KMS密钥。

Condition：可选，表示授权生效的限制条件。通过使用条件可以评估API请求的上下文，以确定策略语句是否适用。格式为`"Condition": {"condition operator": {"condition key": "condition value"}}`。详细介绍，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2716468.html。

授权给其他阿里云账号下的RAM用户、RAM角色后，您仍需在访问控制RAM侧，使用该RAM用户、RAM角色的阿里云账号为其授权使用该密钥，RAM用户、RAM角色才能使用该密钥。集体操作，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/480682.html、https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/116146.html、https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/116147.html
